sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Comment Service
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ
    participant NS as NotificationService
    participant AC as AuthClient
    participant NR as NotificationRepository
    participant MS as MailService
    participant DB as MySQL (notification_db)
    participant MAIL as Mailpit

    Note over CS,MAIL: Comment Notification Flow (Event-Driven)
    CS->>RMQ: publish("comment.new", payload)
    RMQ->>NS: @RabbitListener onComment(payload)
    NS->>NR: save(notification)
    NR->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications
    NS->>AC: getUser(recipientId)
    AC-->>NS: UserResponse (email)
    NS->>MS: send(email, title, htmlBody)
    MS->>MAIL: SMTP email

    Note over CS,MAIL: Admin Broadcast Flow
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant ANC as AdminNotificationController

    FE->>GW: POST /api/admin/notifications/broadcast
    GW->>ANC: Forward (ADMIN role)
    ANC->>NS: broadcast(request, principal)
    NS->>AC: searchUsers("")
    AC-->>NS: List of all users
    loop For each user
        NS->>NR: save(notification)
        NR->>DB: INSERT
        NS->>AC: getUser(userId)
        NS->>MS: send(email, title, html)
    end
    NS->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs
    NS->>RMQ: publish("admin.broadcast", payload)
    NS-->>ANC: void
    ANC-->>GW: 200 OK
    GW-->>FE: Response
